{
  "custom": {
    "data": {}
  },
  "params": {},
  "propConfig": {
    "custom.data": {
      "binding": {
        "config": {
          "expression": "runScript(\"demo.data.line_page\", 5000, {session.custom.line})"
        },
        "type": "expr"
      },
      "persistent": false
    }
  },
  "props": {
    "defaultSize": {
      "height": 1024,
      "width": 1712
    }
  },
  "root": {
    "children": [
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "meta": {
                  "name": "Eyebrow"
                },
                "position": {
                  "basis": "auto",
                  "grow": 0,
                  "shrink": 0
                },
                "props": {
                  "style": {
                    "classes": "Demo/Eyebrow"
                  },
                  "text": "Selected line"
                },
                "type": "ia.display.label"
              },
              {
                "meta": {
                  "name": "Title"
                },
                "position": {
                  "basis": "auto",
                  "grow": 0,
                  "shrink": 0
                },
                "props": {
                  "style": {
                    "classes": "Demo/PageTitle"
                  },
                  "text": "Line Performance"
                },
                "type": "ia.display.label"
              },
              {
                "meta": {
                  "name": "Subtitle"
                },
                "position": {
                  "basis": "auto",
                  "grow": 0,
                  "shrink": 0
                },
                "propConfig": {
                  "props.text": {
                    "binding": {
                      "config": {
                        "path": "view.custom.data.meta.subtitle"
                      },
                      "type": "property"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "props": {
                  "style": {
                    "classes": "Demo/PageSubtitle"
                  }
                },
                "type": "ia.display.label"
              }
            ],
            "meta": {
              "name": "Titles"
            },
            "position": {
              "basis": "0px",
              "grow": 1,
              "shrink": 1
            },
            "props": {
              "direction": "column",
              "style": {
                "classes": "Demo/Stack"
              }
            },
            "type": "ia.container.flex"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "name": "Heading"
        },
        "position": {
          "basis": "auto",
          "grow": 0,
          "shrink": 0
        },
        "props": {
          "alignItems": "flex-end",
          "style": {
            "classes": "Demo/Row"
          }
        },
        "type": "ia.container.flex"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "meta": {
                      "name": "Title"
                    },
                    "position": {
                      "basis": "auto",
                      "grow": 0,
                      "shrink": 0
                    },
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "classes": "Demo/CardTitle"
                      },
                      "text": "Coming next"
                    },
                    "type": "ia.display.label"
                  },
                  {
                    "meta": {
                      "name": "Hint"
                    },
                    "position": {
                      "basis": "0px",
                      "grow": 1,
                      "shrink": 1
                    },
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "classes": "Demo/CardHint"
                      },
                      "text": "see CONVENTIONS.md"
                    },
                    "type": "ia.display.label"
                  }
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "name": "Header"
                },
                "position": {
                  "basis": "auto",
                  "grow": 0,
                  "shrink": 0
                },
                "props": {
                  "alignItems": "center",
                  "style": {
                    "classes": "Demo/CardHeader"
                  }
                },
                "type": "ia.container.flex"
              },
              {
                "meta": {
                  "name": "Text"
                },
                "position": {
                  "basis": "auto",
                  "grow": 1,
                  "shrink": 1
                },
                "props": {
                  "source": "**Line Performance** is not built yet.\n\nIts sample data is ready: `demo.data.line_page(line)` in the project library already returns everything listed here, and this view polls it into `view.custom.data`.\n\nPlanned components:\n\n- KPI Tiles for the selected line\n- OEE Summary and Waterfall (planned time to productive time)\n- Industrial Trend of line speed (4 h)\n- State Timeline per machine\n- Pareto and Downtime Tracker\n- Radar Comparison of the three lines",
                  "style": {
                    "classes": "Demo/Body"
                  }
                },
                "type": "ia.display.markdown"
              }
            ],
            "meta": {
              "name": "Planned"
            },
            "position": {
              "basis": "520px",
              "grow": 0,
              "shrink": 1
            },
            "props": {
              "direction": "column",
              "style": {
                "classes": "Demo/Card",
                "minHeight": "240px",
                "minWidth": "0px"
              }
            },
            "type": "ia.container.flex"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "meta": {
              "name": "Spacer"
            },
            "position": {
              "basis": "0px",
              "grow": 1,
              "shrink": 1
            },
            "type": "ia.container.flex"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "name": "Content"
        },
        "position": {
          "basis": "auto",
          "grow": 0,
          "shrink": 0
        },
        "props": {
          "style": {
            "classes": "Demo/Row"
          },
          "wrap": "wrap"
        },
        "type": "ia.container.flex"
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "name": "root"
    },
    "props": {
      "direction": "column",
      "style": {
        "classes": "Demo/Page"
      }
    },
    "type": "ia.container.flex"
  }
}